      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it's just not how it works. i've seen the way people look at me. i've felt the way they pull away. it's like a pattern that's just built into me. how can you say i deserve support when all i do is cause problems? it doesn't feel like there's an actual way for me to be \"better\" when this is just my nature.",
